    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div><p><em>“If it stands, it can fall.”</em></p><p><strong>Archetype (Bad Eden): The Tower (Breaker).</strong> You are structural collapse, breach doctrine, and the terrible logic of proving that a thing was never as stable as it claimed.</p><h3>Archetype Effects</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Faction Edge.</strong> Your archetype strengthens demolition, disruption, breach operations, and catastrophic openings. Your Domain earns <strong>+10 Violence</strong> marks each turn while you serve it.</p></li><li><p><strong>Tier Engine.</strong> See this Archetype’s Tier feats (Tier 1–4) for your full tactical and strategic toolkit.</p></li></ul>",
